":"Haha, that's right. Under Ootomo's instruction, I've been composing another poem with an Inazuman style, although admittedly I'm still quite the amateur.","nextNodeIds":[726920104]},{"nodeId":726920104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30173,"speakerName":"Lenne","textMapHash":1229886026,"text":"The theme of this poem is \"friendship,\" and indeed both of us can only lament that we did not meet sooner. One of the lines I would like to write depicts animals wandering the landscape in companionship with one another.","nextNodeIds":[726920105]},{"nodeId":726920105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30173,"speakerName":"Lenne","textMapHash":3522585946,"text":"Since this is an Inazuman poem, we must reference <color=#00E1FFFF>creatures unique to these lands</color>.","nextNodeIds":[726920106]},{"nodeId":726920106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":525085722,"text":"We do see animals unique to Inazuma pretty often — whether it be ones that walk or fly...","nextNodeIds":[726920107]},{"nodeId":726920107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":510122394,"text":"#But since they all appear out in the wild, let's head out and search for them, {NICKNAME}.","nextNodeIds":[726920108]},{"nodeId":726920108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30173,"speakerName":"Lenne","textMapHash":2664797754,"text":"I am in your debt! Please help me take <color=#00E1FFFF>4</color> photos of different animals from Inazuma, then.","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7269201,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANL